WEBVTT

00:16.090 --> 00:19.360
All the unfair stuff that adults keep doing?

00:19.540 --> 00:19.580
PRESENTED BY DOUTEI SUBS

00:23.710 --> 00:26.330
"You better keep your promises!"

00:26.330 --> 00:28.580
Look who's talking!

00:28.580 --> 00:30.360
As if!

00:30.360 --> 00:32.450
Live by what you preach.

00:33.540 --> 00:36.440
All those misplaced sympathies,

00:36.440 --> 00:38.970
nuh-uh, no way, I don't want.

00:38.970 --> 00:41.620
"I'm only saying this for your own sake!"

00:41.620 --> 00:43.680
I can smell the lie from here.

00:43.680 --> 00:46.520
When I hear your true desires,

00:46.520 --> 00:49.090
I dunno what I'll do from there.

00:49.090 --> 00:50.280
Should we do it?

00:50.280 --> 00:54.410
That's for me to decide.

00:54.410 --> 00:58.670
"If I spoil her, she'll just take advantage of it."

00:58.670 --> 01:04.120
You are so thickheaded, you'll never understand.

01:04.450 --> 01:08.770
If you truly care for me, it will surely lead to

01:08.770 --> 01:13.390
me becoming a more honest, gentle girl.

01:13.890 --> 01:18.470
And I hope you find me totally adorable.

01:18.910 --> 01:21.370
That I'll be.

01:21.370 --> 01:23.960
That's true.

01:23.960 --> 01:25.990
Naturally.

01:32.650 --> 01:37.610
5th Period

01:32.650 --> 01:37.610
SUMMER STUDY BUDDY

01:35.790 --> 01:37.660
Sensei!

01:39.770 --> 01:43.630
I can finally do a handstand!

01:43.630 --> 01:44.970
Wanna watch?

01:47.210 --> 01:50.350
Mimi-chan, are you going
somewhere for summer vacation?

01:50.350 --> 01:54.190
Yeah, I'm going to see my dad
who's working away from home.

01:54.190 --> 01:56.970
I'm going to Nagano to see my granny!

01:56.970 --> 02:00.590
Hey! Come <i>on,</i> Sensei!

02:00.590 --> 02:03.850
Quit shaking me, Kokonoe! I'm busy now, we can do it later!

02:06.770 --> 02:09.440
Don't blow me off!

02:10.810 --> 02:15.790
During this summer vacation, may you continue to act like children from Futatsubashi Elementary.

02:15.790 --> 02:22.210
Be bright, cheerful, and boisterous, and be sure to make each day a special day.

02:22.210 --> 02:25.430
Whenever you play outside, whenever you play inside your homes,

02:25.430 --> 02:30.290
anywhere you play, you are bound to make new discoveries.

02:33.810 --> 02:35.570
Are those the report cards?

02:35.570 --> 02:36.790
Yeah...

02:36.790 --> 02:39.550
I was wondering if I should go with these.

02:39.550 --> 02:41.930
Huh? You're still not sure how to grade them?

02:42.210 --> 02:45.740
They're all good kids, and I want to give everybody high marks.

02:45.740 --> 02:49.560
But then it won't be fair to the
kids that got good scores.

02:49.560 --> 02:54.850
Teachers must've had it easy in my day, since they graded us on a curve.

02:54.850 --> 02:58.440
They gave the top kids "excellents" while the others received "goods."

02:58.660 --> 03:02.150
Oh? Right now I make use of that method.

03:02.150 --> 03:07.580
I total up the test scores and make three groups: "excellent," "good," and "fair."

03:08.670 --> 03:11.890
That way there's no meaning behind those grades!

03:11.890 --> 03:14.210
There are kids who work hard
despite getting bad grades!

03:14.550 --> 03:17.630
Isn't measuring personal effort
completely subjective on your part?

03:18.870 --> 03:21.880
But we <i>should</i> evaluate
effort, however intangible-

03:21.880 --> 03:25.890
If we do that, the kids will merely <i>act</i> good in front of teachers.

03:25.890 --> 03:29.270
However that may be, test scores
shouldn't be everything!

03:29.610 --> 03:31.230
I understand that perfectly.

03:31.230 --> 03:34.560
But don't you want that view to be reflected in their report cards!

03:33.810 --> 03:34.560
<i>Sheesh.</i>

03:34.560 --> 03:38.550
You are <i>not</i> to insert your emotions into report cards!

03:34.560 --> 03:38.030
<i>You're earnest, but you're still bad at arguing.</i>

03:39.750 --> 03:44.570
<i>But, for you to clearly express
your opinions with such passion...</i>

03:40.030 --> 03:45.520
Who will evaluate the kids who are working hard?

03:44.570 --> 03:47.280
<i>You have truly grown, Aoki-sensei.</i>

03:45.520 --> 03:47.290
I thought <i>we</i> were the teachers!

03:50.450 --> 03:52.230
<i>H... Huh?</i>

03:52.230 --> 03:53.430
<i>This feeling just now...</i>

03:53.430 --> 03:55.170
You just can't win in this line of work.

03:57.450 --> 03:59.670
Well, he's still new at this...

03:59.670 --> 04:04.050
That kind of puerile thinking is only short-lived, Aoki-sensei.

04:00.290 --> 04:02.770
Nope, I meant Shirai-sensei.

04:02.770 --> 04:04.050
Eh?

04:08.260 --> 04:10.850
<i>Shriveled up Queen Of All Everything!</i>

04:10.850 --> 04:15.750
<i>Cripes! Now I'm even less sure
of how to grade my students!</i>

04:17.290 --> 04:18.800
Kokonoe?

04:19.710 --> 04:21.170
Sensei.

04:21.170 --> 04:23.980
What's wrong? The bell's about to ring.

04:23.980 --> 04:25.790
Come on, let's get to class.

04:26.620 --> 04:27.160
No way!

04:28.790 --> 04:31.450
What do you mean "no way"?  Come on, get up.

04:31.450 --> 04:32.540
I said no way!

04:36.290 --> 04:40.690
What the heck is wrong with you? You've been acting self-centered since morning.

04:46.230 --> 04:47.930
What's bothering you-

04:47.930 --> 04:49.500
It's almost summer vacation!

04:52.350 --> 04:53.310
Eh?

04:57.470 --> 05:02.030
When summer vacation starts,
I won't be able to see you.

05:02.510 --> 05:03.780
That's stup-

05:03.780 --> 05:05.690
Why would that...

05:09.490 --> 05:13.540
<i>Lord help me. I'd hate her guts if she weren't so cute.</i>

05:15.510 --> 05:17.540
It'll be all right.

05:17.990 --> 05:21.290
Even during summer vacation, I'll still be coming to school.

05:21.290 --> 05:25.230
There are conferences, extra school days, and then there's the pool.

05:25.230 --> 05:27.550
You can see me whenever you want.

05:27.550 --> 05:29.070
You swear?

05:29.070 --> 05:30.150
Yep!

05:32.550 --> 05:35.690
All right. Do you wanna
see me do a handstand?

05:35.690 --> 05:36.560
Sure.

05:37.210 --> 05:38.560
Watch this!

05:39.550 --> 05:41.050
Wait! Your skirt!

05:41.050 --> 05:43.570
I'm wearing bloomers!

05:43.570 --> 05:46.170
Hoho! Very good!

05:49.130 --> 05:51.290
Sensei, you creep!

05:51.290 --> 05:52.540
How is it <i>my</i> fault?

05:56.040 --> 05:56.080
REPORT CARD
CLASS 3-1
USA MIMI

05:56.370 --> 05:59.230
Usa, you've studied very hard!

05:59.230 --> 06:01.570
Make sure you keep up the good work!

06:01.570 --> 06:02.550
Thanks!

06:02.550 --> 06:06.050
Kokonoe, you're way too inconsistent.

06:06.050 --> 06:08.170
You need to apply yourself
to subjects you don't like.

06:08.170 --> 06:09.390
All righty!

06:10.630 --> 06:13.630
Kagami, I know you can do it if you try!

06:13.630 --> 06:15.140
Do your best next semester!

06:16.850 --> 06:18.640
You call <i>that</i> sugarcoating?!

06:18.640 --> 06:19.980
See ya!

06:19.290 --> 06:20.600
Bye!

06:19.980 --> 06:21.190
Sensei, bye-bye!

06:21.190 --> 06:23.460
Be sure to help out around the house!

06:23.460 --> 06:24.650
Let's go home.

06:25.270 --> 06:27.450
Don't stay up too late!

06:27.450 --> 06:29.170
Sensei, goodbye!

06:29.170 --> 06:30.510
Ahh, thank gawd!

06:30.510 --> 06:34.250
Now I won't have to see that
virgin's face anytime soon!

06:37.960 --> 06:40.460
K-Kokonoe!

06:45.030 --> 06:47.390
If you cheat on me, I won't forgive you!

06:47.390 --> 06:48.970
What're you, stupid?

06:48.970 --> 06:51.390
Rin-chan, let's get going!

06:49.830 --> 06:52.570
See ya, Sensei!

07:00.850 --> 07:01.770
All wrapped up?

07:01.770 --> 07:03.010
Oh...

07:04.110 --> 07:06.280
Gosh, it feels kinda weird.

07:07.490 --> 07:11.590
To think that tomorrow there
won't be any kids in this room...

07:13.530 --> 07:19.410
You know, as a kid, I've always felt let down whenever summer vacation ends.

07:19.410 --> 07:22.810
Now I feel let down when it starts.

07:24.290 --> 07:25.790
I know how you feel.

07:38.810 --> 07:41.410
Doing the Second Exercise is a little embarrassing.

07:41.410 --> 07:44.810
That's for sure. We should
just stick to the First.

08:00.450 --> 08:02.210
BE QUIET

08:00.450 --> 08:02.210
A

08:17.570 --> 08:20.470
Mimi-chan, can you rub some oil on me?

08:20.470 --> 08:21.730
Sure!

08:22.160 --> 08:26.890
We aren't going to the beach this year, so I need to get a perfect tan this way.

08:26.890 --> 08:30.290
Kuro-chan, didn't you say you
wanted an alabaster skin?

08:30.290 --> 08:34.240
This year's trend is a bronze
skin with feminine dresses.

08:37.030 --> 08:38.970
She's spacing out again.

08:38.970 --> 08:42.020
Oh, but you know Rin-chan's...

08:47.750 --> 08:51.460
What the-! Kuro-<i>chan</i>!

08:59.270 --> 09:01.310
This blows.

09:04.890 --> 09:08.750
Hurry up... hurry up... hurry up...

09:14.050 --> 09:18.770
Wow! You didn't just put a pink
one in, there's also a green one!

09:19.410 --> 09:22.930
I'm heading back to the office. If
anything happens, send me a text.

09:22.930 --> 09:24.090
Uh-huh!

09:24.890 --> 09:29.210
Rin... I'm sorry I couldn't take you somewhere.

09:29.210 --> 09:30.850
Nuh-uh!

09:30.850 --> 09:34.210
It's all right, I'm doing a lot with
Kuro-chan and Mimi-chan!

09:37.350 --> 09:39.490
I'll see you later!

09:48.530 --> 09:51.530
<i>Rin... she tries so hard to be cheerful...</i>

09:55.290 --> 09:58.090
<i>I really need to see how I can
get some vacation time.</i>

10:05.250 --> 10:11.560
<i>My</i> swimsuits are way cuter.
School swimsuits are so blah!

10:12.250 --> 10:15.350
Rin-chan!

10:16.150 --> 10:18.760
Coming!

10:22.230 --> 10:25.390
Water quality... check!

10:27.670 --> 10:31.850
I really need to study and build up my skills during summer break.

10:33.350 --> 10:38.220
"When your children are noisy, you
distract them with quizzes and such..."

10:38.220 --> 10:39.660
Aoki-sensei?

10:40.360 --> 10:43.910
H-Houin-sensei! That swimsuit...

10:43.910 --> 10:49.160
Er, um, the look and size of the
one-piece didn't match up with me.

10:50.100 --> 10:53.090
S... So you say.

10:53.810 --> 10:56.960
D... Does it look weird?

10:57.870 --> 11:00.030
No, not at all. It's just...

11:00.030 --> 11:01.960
I think it's unfair!

11:02.850 --> 11:03.970
Kokonoe!

11:03.970 --> 11:08.910
It's not fair that we have to wear school swimsuits while Sensei gets to wear her bikini!

11:09.990 --> 11:14.610
She does have a point. Aoki-sensei, I'm going to go back and change.

11:14.950 --> 11:17.090
R-Right...

11:19.170 --> 11:23.450
Aww, he was blushing the whole time. Yuck City!

11:34.110 --> 11:36.500
Hey, you there! No running!

11:38.750 --> 11:42.310
<i>S-She would have looked better in that bikini.</i>

11:47.670 --> 11:50.140
Looks like Sensei's just another guy!

11:50.740 --> 11:52.640
I guess so.

11:54.520 --> 11:56.370
What are you doing, Rin-chan?

11:56.370 --> 11:58.770
Are you in heat or something?

11:58.770 --> 12:03.430
They say your breasts will get bigger if you massage them.

12:04.090 --> 12:06.070
After this, you do your armpits.

12:06.070 --> 12:07.860
Here?!

12:08.340 --> 12:09.540
Kuro-chaaan!

12:11.530 --> 12:13.770
Oh, thanks for coming!

12:13.770 --> 12:15.790
Sensei, goodbye!

12:15.790 --> 12:16.790
All right.

13:09.730 --> 13:12.680
"Today I did my schoolwork at home."

13:13.230 --> 13:19.410
"Kuro-chan went to her grandmother's house while Mimi-chan went to her father's place."

13:28.270 --> 13:30.150
MATSUNAMI WARD

13:28.270 --> 13:30.150
BIG FIREWORKS

13:28.270 --> 13:30.150
COOL

13:30.830 --> 13:33.190
<i>"You can see me whenever you want."</i>

13:36.010 --> 13:39.040
I can see him... whenever.

13:39.040 --> 13:43.550
MATSUNAMI WARD FUTATSUBASHI ELEMENTARY SCHOOL

14:10.990 --> 14:12.830
I think this looks just about right.

14:13.830 --> 14:16.580
I agree, let's stop here.

14:18.690 --> 14:21.430
Um... are you aware?

14:21.430 --> 14:22.090
Yeah?

14:22.090 --> 14:26.030
Today we're having a fireworks
display in the neighborhood park.

14:26.030 --> 14:28.130
Huh, is that right?

14:28.130 --> 14:33.350
The students are probably going to be there, and with them comes trouble...

14:33.350 --> 14:36.050
So I was thinking we should set up patrols.

14:36.050 --> 14:37.230
Yeah...

14:37.230 --> 14:39.600
But won't the parents from the PTA-

14:39.930 --> 14:41.350
I think we should do it!

14:41.350 --> 14:43.410
Uh... right.

14:44.350 --> 14:47.030
So... um...

14:47.650 --> 14:51.360
When we're finished here...
the two of us could, maybe...

14:52.070 --> 14:53.490
The festival is also coming up...

14:53.490 --> 14:57.910
I mean, kids are also excitable during festivals...

14:54.010 --> 14:55.740
Kokonoe?

14:55.740 --> 14:58.890
Uh... hey! Kokonoe!

15:00.110 --> 15:01.290
Aoki-sensei?

15:08.170 --> 15:09.790
Kokonoe...

15:09.790 --> 15:11.490
...alone in the building?

15:21.230 --> 15:22.730
That's wrong!

15:26.450 --> 15:29.650
You can see everything from that very spot.

15:32.690 --> 15:34.730
Don't toss my panties!

15:34.730 --> 15:35.780
Why you little...

15:36.610 --> 15:38.540
It's feels so nice and breezy!

15:39.170 --> 15:40.270
I've had just about enou...

15:40.270 --> 15:41.540
Look!

15:42.650 --> 15:46.290
Good little girls always wear bloomers under skirts!

15:49.300 --> 15:51.710
Kokonoe!

15:57.910 --> 15:59.720
Aoki-sensei!

16:00.310 --> 16:05.350
If I don't find those two quickly, the fireworks will...

16:06.820 --> 16:11.890
Uh - that's not it! I'm worried
about Kokonoe. Kokonoe.

16:15.230 --> 16:17.630
Rin-chan!

16:20.110 --> 16:24.510
I came back as early as I could so that we can see the fireworks together!

16:24.510 --> 16:26.710
Oh, Kuro-chan!

16:27.670 --> 16:29.190
Mimi-chan!

16:35.250 --> 16:36.720
Kokonoe!

17:07.810 --> 17:11.310
Why do you have to be such a problem?

17:11.310 --> 17:13.510
Showing up at school without notice.

17:13.510 --> 17:14.930
You said...

17:14.930 --> 17:15.750
Uh?

17:16.590 --> 17:19.100
You said I could come whenever I want.

17:19.100 --> 17:23.600
Well, you're right, but not like this.

17:23.970 --> 17:27.030
Look, it's getting dark. It's
time for you to go home.

17:27.810 --> 17:28.860
No.

17:33.310 --> 17:34.360
But...

17:35.090 --> 17:38.630
If I do that... you'll...

17:38.630 --> 17:41.470
You'll go and watch the
fireworks with Houin-sensei!

17:45.910 --> 17:47.490
Sensei...

17:48.290 --> 17:50.500
<i>N... Not good!</i>

17:50.890 --> 17:53.510
<i>I've just been through this scene...</i>

17:53.930 --> 17:57.790
<i>This scenario can't allow itself to play out, ever.</i>

17:57.790 --> 18:01.990
<i>We're in the perfect setting for it too.</i>

18:03.690 --> 18:04.770
Sensei...

18:04.770 --> 18:07.430
D-Don't do it, Kokonoe!

18:07.430 --> 18:11.900
You're still in grade school, and I don't share those feelings at all-

18:12.330 --> 18:13.400
Sensei...

18:16.730 --> 18:18.910
I told you I'd never forgive
you if you betrayed me!

18:19.290 --> 18:19.910
Huh?

18:26.430 --> 18:29.420
Kokonoe... you were...

18:31.310 --> 18:33.420
Sensei, your glasses are slipping!

18:34.550 --> 18:37.690
What are you going to do
now that you're all wet?

18:37.690 --> 18:38.430
Now getting home will be-

18:43.070 --> 18:44.990
I don't have to go home.

18:53.170 --> 18:55.450
We can always stay here.

18:56.890 --> 18:59.450
That's stupid. You'll catch a cold-

19:10.790 --> 19:12.250
Pretty!

19:26.030 --> 19:27.010
<i>It sure is.</i>

19:27.970 --> 19:28.020
A

19:27.970 --> 19:28.020
Burubu
Japon

19:27.970 --> 19:28.020
Play and
eat with
your kid
during
summer
break

19:27.970 --> 19:28.020
Go to the beach!
Take your family on
a lavish yet affordable
resort trip

19:27.970 --> 19:28.020
August
350¥

19:43.470 --> 19:45.410
Tamaya!

19:45.950 --> 19:48.830
It's very beautiful, right Kuro-chan?

19:48.830 --> 19:51.390
The ghost of the cotton candy geezer.

19:54.710 --> 19:56.770
An old woman.

19:56.770 --> 19:58.460
Kuro-chan...

20:00.270 --> 20:03.310
It's boring without Rin-chan around.

20:07.750 --> 20:10.060
That was huge!

20:11.750 --> 20:14.940
<i>I just can't explain it.</i>

20:15.410 --> 20:19.850
<i>She gives me such a hard time,
causes so much trouble...</i>

20:19.850 --> 20:23.950
<i>But I still can't get mad at her. Instead, I...</i>

20:26.330 --> 20:27.450
Houin-sensei!

20:27.450 --> 20:29.450
What's going on here?

20:29.970 --> 20:33.690
Um... er... you got the wrong idea!

20:33.690 --> 20:36.550
Come on, Kokonoe, let's get out!

20:36.550 --> 20:37.090
Hey!

20:37.420 --> 20:39.590
You have to carry me!

20:39.590 --> 20:40.880
Why you...

20:40.880 --> 20:42.630
Huggie!

20:49.570 --> 20:52.670
Your jersey is so baggy!

20:52.670 --> 20:55.950
You could have borrowed
the one from Houin-sensei.

20:55.950 --> 20:57.020
It's all good!

21:04.150 --> 21:05.030
Rin?

21:05.570 --> 21:06.850
I'm home!

21:11.910 --> 21:11.950
I WENT TO
SCHOOL

21:20.170 --> 21:22.050
What are you girls doing here?!

21:22.790 --> 21:25.170
We're sunbathing at school.

21:25.170 --> 21:27.570
But those outfits are not...

21:27.570 --> 21:32.060
We're not at the pool, so we don't
have to wear school swimsuits, do we?

21:32.060 --> 21:34.060
That's <i>not</i> what I'm getting at.

21:35.870 --> 21:40.060
I'm going to watch you <i>reeeal</i> close during summer break so you won't stray again.

21:47.860 --> 21:49.940
I was tied by the rules crying my eyes out.

21:49.940 --> 21:52.520
Was I fed up so much I hit "C" and flew?

21:52.520 --> 21:54.950
If you wanna taste, go ahead and try it on the fly

21:54.950 --> 21:56.570
Heart racing, I get a flower on my test, smile and go

22:02.950 --> 22:05.520
Geh! No way! I'm not waiting ten years to LOVE LOVE!

22:05.520 --> 22:08.070
I can't resist, I've been dreaming of it ALL NIGHT.

22:08.070 --> 22:09.980
I will do what you say, MAYBE.

22:09.980 --> 22:13.150
For you, right now we'll have our WEDDING.

22:13.150 --> 22:15.670
Just tender kisses? NO NO! Adult thinking.

22:15.670 --> 22:18.220
We're taking it further and forceful - GO! IN!

22:18.220 --> 22:20.070
A HEART BEAT that is so loud.

22:20.070 --> 22:22.960
That's just how I do things, baby.

22:23.290 --> 22:28.560
Convey your feelings for me

22:28.560 --> 22:33.160
not with words, but through warm kisses.

22:33.160 --> 22:37.320
Let's turn our entire world

22:37.320 --> 22:43.290
upside down, right now.

22:44.010 --> 22:46.150
A girl's punch will get through, don't you think?

22:46.150 --> 22:48.760
Will the surprise be enough to attract you?

22:48.760 --> 22:51.220
A thought-over impulse is also great

22:51.220 --> 22:53.800
LUCKY I gobbled down your earlobe.

22:53.800 --> 22:56.290
Kiss! I was tied by the rules crying my eyes out.

22:56.290 --> 22:58.830
Was I fed up so much I hit "C" and flew?

22:58.830 --> 23:01.300
If you wanna taste, go ahead and try it on the fly.

23:01.300 --> 23:02.800
Heart racing, I get a flower on my test, smile and go

23:06.720 --> 23:11.490
Baby, I want you, ahhhh

23:15.160 --> 23:27.130
NEXT EPISODE

23:15.840 --> 23:18.400
The wavelets form the morning tides.

23:19.030 --> 23:22.280
They reflect the hues of heaven on the sandy beach.

23:22.280 --> 23:23.910
The shards of glass...

23:24.710 --> 23:26.630
...shimmer brilliant.

23:27.000 --> 23:30.130
Such is... my pain.

23:27.160 --> 23:30.130
